    "reading": "Today the uncapped scan costs 17 s of sketch scoring against a 1,200 s budget, so the skew is not yet fatal -- and saying otherwise would be dishonest. It is fatal on the board's timescale: it is the only term in the pipeline that grows quadratically, and it is what turned the old all-pairs job into 31 hours."
